# `host/`, `app/`, `migrations/`, `tools/` and the two textproto files are the source of
# truth. `traildepot/` is a build artefact assembled from them by clear_db.bat + build.bat,
# so everything in it is generated and git-ignored.
traildepot/config.textproto
traildepot/metadata.textproto
traildepot/migrations/
traildepot/runtime/

# TrailBase runtime state.
traildepot/data/
traildepot/backups/
traildepot/uploads/
traildepot/secrets/
traildepot/wasm/
*.log

# Rust build output for the guest component.
host/target/

# Throw-away depot the tools create when they run.
.tbdemo-guest/
